    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>护甲（中甲），非普通（需同调）</em><br />这套护甲具有5发充能。穿着这套护甲期间，你可以用附赠动作消耗1发充能来用这套护甲，以自己为目标施展以下法术之一：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.1B8U6kl0egesx3FK]{跳跃术 Jump}</em>（1充能）或<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.GNvrHluGdgqD06wZ]{浮空术 Levitate}</em> （2充能）。<br />这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d4 + 1]]发已被消耗的充能数。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">钉刺甲是一种罕见的中甲，它们出自矮人工匠之手，造型看上去像是覆盖了金属尖刺的皮革外套和护腿。</span></p><p>This armor has 5 charges. While you wear it, you can use a bonus action to expend 1 or more charges to cast one of the following spells from the armor, targeting yourself: @spell[Jump] (1 charge) or @spell[Levitate] (2 charges).</p><p>This armor regains [[/r 1d4 + 1]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Spiked armor is a rare type of medium armor made by dwarves. It consists of a leather coat and leggings covered with spikes that are usually made of metal.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
